<title>BRAZIL: BRAZIL REAL SLIPS 0.02 PCT IN FOREX COMMERCIAL MKT.</title>
<headline>BRAZIL REAL SLIPS 0.02 PCT IN FOREX COMMERCIAL MKT.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil's real fell 0.02 percent to close at 1.0842 per dollar in calm trading in the commercial foreign exchange market Wednesday, dealers said.</p>
<p>In the interbank floating rate market, the real closed up 0.01 percent at 1.0896 per greenback, while in the parallel market the real currency rose 0.18 percent to end at 1.135 per dollar.</p>
<p>((--Sao Paulo newsroom 5511 2485412))</p>
